<title>UK: TABLE-UK'S Kenwood Appliances profits dip.</title>
<headline>TABLE-UK'S Kenwood Appliances profits dip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 4, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		    29.3 loss  vs    23.8 profit</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)		nil	 vs     na</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)     3.25	 vs    10.0</p>
<p> Pre-tax *			 4.1	 vs    15.6</p>
<p> Turnover		     203.2	  vs   196.7</p>
<p>NOTE - *The profits are before taking exceptional charges of 15.5 million stg into account.</p>
<p>Full company name - Kenwood Appliances Plc.</p>
